<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25056" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Īsis</span></b> , is, and ĭdis.
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἶσις,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the Egyptian
				goddess Isis</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 3, 19, 47</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 9,
				772</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tac. G. 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Luc. 9,
			158</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> Isidis crinis,
				<i>an unknown plant</i>, Juba ap. <i><span class="en">Plin. 13,
				25, 52, § 142</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Isidis sidus, <i>the
				planet Venus</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 8, 6, §
			37</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Deriv. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Īsĭăcus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰσιακός,</span>
			<i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Isis</i>:
			conjectores, Enn. ap. <i><span class="en">Cic. Div. 1, 58, 132</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">focus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					P. 1, 1, 52</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Isiacae sacraria lenae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					6, 488</span></i>
			.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Īsĭă-cus</span></b> ,
				i, m., <i>a priest of
				Isis</i>, <i><span class="en">Suet. Dom. 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 7,
				3, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 27, 7, 29, § 53
		al.</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
